00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.080
here's how to sacrifice your queen&nbsp;
to checkmate your opponent start&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:13.360
with pawn to e4 black responds pawn to e5 white&nbsp;
develops knight to f3 black responds knight c6&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:20.400
white goes bishop to c4 if black plays&nbsp;
d6 here's where the trap comes into play&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:24.960
develop the knight to c3 black&nbsp;
pins the knight to the queen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:34.800
pawn to h3 attacking the bishop bishop to h5&nbsp;
now lay the trap knight takes e5 if the bishop&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:46.640
captures the queen take on f7 the only move out of&nbsp;
check for black is e7 then knight to d5 checkmate

